        "date_published": "2026-09-22T13:04:14+00:00",
        "description": "You've probably seen posts on social media of exotic animals kept as pets, but behind the clips lies a troubling reality.\n\nResearch commissioned by the International Fund for Animal Welfare, based on a sample of 620 UK wild pet owners, revealed that 54% did not know whether their current or past wild pets required a licence.\n\nIt also found that 29% believe celebrity and online content encourage wild pet ownership.\n\nSubscribe to our channel here: https://bbc.in/bbcnews\n\nFor the latest news download the BBC News app or visit BBC.com/news\n\n#SocialMedia #Animals #BBCNews",
